---
# Required. URL: /research/<slug>
slug: your-article-slug

# Required. Quote the title if it contains a colon.
title: "Your article title"

# Required. Publication date, YYYY-MM-DD.
date: 2024-01-15

# Required. Text of the card on /research.
summary: >-
  One or two sentences for the research index card. Folded YAML (`>-`) strips
  the single newline; use a blank line in the body for longer abstracts.

# Optional. List of topics.
tags:
  - topic-one
  - topic-two

# Optional. PDF path or URL; shown as a download link when set.
resume: ""
---

